data: {"id":"eLAVGYQCkQI","title":"What’s on My Desk 2025 | Clean, Modern & Productive Setup","channel":"JB","views":10789,"duration_s":463,"upload_date":"2025-10-19","description":"My 2025 desk setup is finally complete. This space has become my creative zone — built for productivity, comfort, and clean aesthetics. From the Mac Mini M4 powering it all to the 43-inch LG smart monitor and a few simple details that make it personal, every piece here has a purpose.\n\nI’ll walk you through everything on my desk — what I use daily for editing, creating, and staying inspired. Whether you’re setting up your own workspace or just love a good clean setup, hopefully this gives you some ideas to elevate yours.\n\n✳️ SHOP MY DESK SETUP (Affiliate Links Below)\n\nMac Mini M4: https://amzn.to/4nVicJL\n43” LG Smart Monitor: \nQuntis Monitor Light Bar: https://amzn.to/48DUBsq\nUnder Desk Foot Rest: https://amzn.to/3JkAuoO\n2TB SSD Drive (Working Drive): https://amzn.to/3KYMYmv\nSeagate 8TB External Hard Drive: https://amzn.to/3JjALID\nKeychron K3 Keyboard: https://amzn.to/3WxPtyZ\nMagic Mouse 2: https://amzn.to/3JhRfkq\nSennheiser Profile USB Mic: https://amzn.to/42K66uH\nSonos One Speakers: https://amzn.to/3Wg1Kb1\nLEGO Orchid: https://amzn.to/4qgs1DF\n\nlinks  👇🏾\nAMAZON STOREFRONT \nhttps://www.amazon.com/shop/johnthebaptistla\n\nMore Places to find me 👇🏾\nInstagram | www.instagram.com/johnthebaptistla/\nTik Tok | https://tiktok.com/@JohnBaptistla\n\n\nhttps://www.amazon.com/shop/johnthebaptistla\n\n\n\n\nBusiness inquiries and collabs: info@johnthebaptistla.com","source":"dataapi:200:ok"}

